> Interpretation and limits

ASCII decimal bytes are the complete input grammar. Leading zeros are preserved,
malformed payload generation throws, and malformed validation returns false.
Empty payload generates digit0 but an empty full identifier is invalid. Error
detection provides no authentication or adversarial integrity guarantee.

The complete editable C++ programs save figures locally; results contain
ordinary computed Markdown. Selected counters describe actual producer
operations, excluding validation when stated.

